# Env files: everything is ignored by default. Only these are committed:
#   .env.development        safe local defaults (NEVER put real secrets in it)
#   .env.*.example          templates with placeholder values
# Real values live in .env.production, .env.local, ... (ignored) or in your hosting/CI.
